        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabini, hayyu Hazori, dubbi tana d'ageennaani qonqo gara hayyoota Shimronitifi Akashafu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gara hayyoota lafa mirga ta gaareeni teetu, gara bale Yordani ta galaana Galilayaatini bitaa, ammalle gara lafa golbootifi lafa afaani galaana ta Dori jed'aniti erge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni qonqo gara worra Kanaanile, ka galaana Yordani gama lachu tau, gara worra Amori, worra Hiti, worra Perezi, worra Yebusi, ka lafa gaareeni taule, ammalle worra Hivi, ka gaara Hermoni jala, lafa Mispa keesa taule, erge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri suni askarti ufi ch'ufa woliini lola gabahe, askarti heddu muumme inqamne, ta aka maansa afaani baariini jirtu ta fardooleefi gaarille qabdu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyooti tunini ch'ufti askarti isii woltuni d'ufte, fulla bisaani Meromuti wolti baate qubatte, aka worra Israeli haatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan Yoshuani jed'e, Worra kana insodaatini, bori hojja tana anini ya worra harka Israelitini hobaase. Fardoole worra mogolcha gaari worrale guba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba Yoshuafi askartini isaa ch'ufti bisaani Meromuti tassa worrati d'ufte haate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi harka worra Israeliti worra kenne; worri Israeli worra reebe haga mirga Mersefoth-Maimufi Sidoni had'e, ammalle haga bale Mispa ilaboru, gusse ch'ufa hobaase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuani akuma AABBO Waaqi isaani jed'e tolche: Fardoole worra mogolche gaari worrale gube.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yoshuani keesa deebie, dira Haziri qabe hayyu isaale ijeese. (Gaafasi hayyuuni dira Hazori hayyoota ch'ufa ira jira.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri nama arti keesa jiru tokole illakimne, ch'ufa fit'e dirale gube.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuani dira kana ch'ufafi hayyoota isaanile qaqabe fit'e, akuma hojattuuni AABBO Waaqa Musani isaani jed'e kaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo hataatu, worri Israeli dira kubile irati jaarani tokole ingumne, Hazori ka Yoshuani gube male. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worri Israeli miha dadansafi hori dira suni keesa jiru ch'ufa boojie. Ammo nama tokole inhambimne, ch'ufa hobaasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma AABBO Waaqi hojattu isaa Musani jed'e, akasuma Musani Yoshuani jed'e, Yoshualeeni tolche guute. Inni woma inhambimne, waan AABBO Waaqi Musani jed'e ch'ufa guute.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lafa Yoshuani fud'ate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuani lafa tana ch'ufa fud'ate — lafa gaareenitifi lafa golbo mirgaafi bitale, lafa Goshenile lafa gamooji ta bitaatifi bale Yordani ch'ufa woliini fud'ate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti inni fud'ate sunini haga gama Halaki ka bitaa d'aatu Edomuti ejite, haga Baal-Gadi ta mirga bale Lebanoni ta gaara Hermonitini bitaati ejiti. Yoshuani haga guyya heddu hayyoota lafa sunitini wolhad'ani, ammo inni worra ch'ufa dabsate hobaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17+JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17",
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diri nagaya worra Israelitini woliini tolfate tokoleeni injiru, dira Gibeoni, ka worra Hivi, male. Ka iraa hafe kaani ch'ufa Yoshuani had'e dabsate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 7.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Woni kunini ch'ufti waan AABBO Waaqi tolche, ka inni garaa worraa jabeese, aka worri worra Israeli had'e, akanaani worri Israeli worra ch'ufa naasu male fit'e hobaase. Akuma AABBO Waaqi Musani jed'e kaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba gaafasi Yoshuani kae worra gugurda d'ed'eera gosa Anaki, ka lafa gaareeni keesa tau fit'e: Worri suni dira Hebroni, ka Deberifi Anabu, ammalle lafa gaareeni ta Yudatifi ta Israeli keesa taa. Yoshuani worraafi dira isaani ch'ufa balleese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami gosa Anaki ka lafa Israeli keesati hafe injiru. Ammo hataatuti, nami diqaani toko dira Gazafi Gathifi Ashdoditi hafe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanaani Yoshuani lafa ch'ufa fud'ate. Akuma AABBO Waaqi Musani jed'e. Duuba Yoshuani lafa suni d'aala worra Israeliti kenne, gosa gosani gargari qoodeefi. Akanaani lafti nagaya argatte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hayyoota Musani dabsate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
